OL,3,GNEWSAPeople queue for water as
OL,4,Athousands without supply
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix thousand properties across
OL,7,FStourbridge, in the West Midlands, have
OL,8,Fbeen without water following a burst
OL,9,Fpipe, with warnings that repairs could
OL,10,Ftake until the weekend.
OL,12,FRidgewood High School and Ashwood Park
OL,13,FPrimary school are closed on Wednesday,
OL,14,Fwith homes and businesses also
OL,15,Faffected.
OL,17,FTwo emergency bottled water stations
OL,18,Fhave been set up, with long queues of
OL,19,Fcars building as people stocked up.
OL,20,FResidents said they had been unable to
OL,21,Fcook, wash or flush their toilets.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
